  "articleBody": "A guest bathroom remodel should balance guest comfort, efficient use of limited space, durable finishes, and the project’s effect on plumbing, electrical, ventilation, and permits. Before hiring, define whether you need cosmetic updates or a layout change, verify what approvals may apply, and request a coordinated design-and-construction scope from the contractor.",
